{"4481510": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Prism Drift", "steam_appid": 4481510, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "controller_support": "full", "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>Grab loot. Die. Upgrade. Try again.</strong></p><br><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Plunge into exciting and intense space battles. Navigate through dangerous asteroid fields, outmaneuver enemy squadrons, and master your ship's unique controls. Every round is a new chance to sharpen your reflexes and learn the enemy's patterns.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4481510/extras/6e52604ad4828361c9e797f5a53b3083.poster.avif?t=1783176805\" aria-label=\"warp in gif\" width=1122 height=716 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4481510/extras/6e52604ad4828361c9e797f5a53b3083.webm?t=1783176805\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4481510/extras/6e52604ad4828361c9e797f5a53b3083.mp4?t=1783176805\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><br><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Even if you lose, it is not in vain. Use your progress to unlock permanent upgrades and powerful new skills in the talent tree. Shape your own unique playstyle and ensure your pilot is much better prepared for the next challenging attempt.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4481510/extras/a29525eac8775c002a760834879cf322.poster.avif?t=1783176805\" aria-label=\"tech tree gif\" width=1170 height=616 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4481510/extras/a29525eac8775c002a760834879cf322.webm?t=1783176805\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4481510/extras/a29525eac8775c002a760834879cf322.mp4?t=1783176805\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><br><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Craft better equipment to dominate the galaxy. The further out into space you fly, the tougher the enemies become and the better gear you will find. Collect rare resources, upgrade your weapon systems in time, and make sure you always stay one step ahead of your enemies.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4481510/extras/42bbd92b97a43205dc19cebfe786dbdc.poster.avif?t=1783176805\" width=1170 height=780 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4481510/extras/42bbd92b97a43205dc19cebfe786dbdc.webm?t=1783176805\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4481510/extras/42bbd92b97a43205dc19cebfe786dbdc.mp4?t=1783176805\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>Grab loot. Die. Upgrade. Try again.</strong></p><br><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Plunge into exciting and intense space battles. Navigate through dangerous asteroid fields, outmaneuver enemy squadrons, and master your ship's unique controls. Every round is a new chance to sharpen your reflexes and learn the enemy's patterns.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4481510/extras/6e52604ad4828361c9e797f5a53b3083.poster.avif?t=1783176805\" aria-label=\"warp in gif\" width=1122 height=716 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4481510/extras/6e52604ad4828361c9e797f5a53b3083.webm?t=1783176805\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4481510/extras/6e52604ad4828361c9e797f5a53b3083.mp4?t=1783176805\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><br><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Even if you lose, it is not in vain. Use your progress to unlock permanent upgrades and powerful new skills in the talent tree. Shape your own unique playstyle and ensure your pilot is much better prepared for the next challenging attempt.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4481510/extras/a29525eac8775c002a760834879cf322.poster.avif?t=1783176805\" aria-label=\"tech tree gif\" width=1170 height=616 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4481510/extras/a29525eac8775c002a760834879cf322.webm?t=1783176805\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4481510/extras/a29525eac8775c002a760834879cf322.mp4?t=1783176805\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><br><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Craft better equipment to dominate the galaxy. The further out into space you fly, the tougher the enemies become and the better gear you will find. Collect rare resources, upgrade your weapon systems in time, and make sure you always stay one step ahead of your enemies.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akama